e as it moves along the path), then ${∮}_{C}F\\cdot \\text{d}r<0.$\n\nWith that in mind, let's check each statement.\n\n- Statement I is false, while statement III is true. It's clear from the picture below that $F$ works against the motion of the particle as it moves counterclockwise along $C.$ \n\n![](images/85/8595904122fac3431fc959b2fa4aa5a3062bd1bffd1a391a0861fa12f2498054.png)\n\nSo, ${∮}_{C}F\\cdot \\text{d}r<0.$\n\n- Statement II is true. It's clear from the picture below that $F$ assists the motion of the particle as it moves **clockwise** along $C.$\n\n![](images/f1/f1f31f2b6eefddedc46b8e845703904c0b4566963e64a644f7a4ab32bb7240c3.png)\n\nSo, ${∮}_{-C}F\\cdot \\text{d}r>0.$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"II and III only.\""} :step/id #uuid "79347290-b94d-53e8-a6ae-104c05d725cf" :step/next {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186455519}} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186455533 :step/content {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186455463 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "32f5e806-242d-5b1a-8886-66c2da17be28" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "I and III only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186454981} {:answer/id #uuid "5b31d58a-98fe-5653-8b2e-f0931877d07f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "I only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186455066} {:answer/id #uuid "708e66ed-fb9c-572e-9876-d3e2f4e3957c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "III only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186455113} {:answer/id #uuid "814fc88c-5be7-5618-be65-2f99b06af468" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "II only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186455137} {:answer/id #uuid "e34fc7a8-8d96-5fc5-a347-b84cc10b6757" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "II and III only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186455296}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186455066} :answer-field/id #uuid "82c6016b-0343-53a1-a3ae-36d3278711ed" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493} :db/id #edb/re